    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Devilry Reservation</strong></i> is a place of exile and residence for various members of the paranormal population, most of whom are monsters of varying degrees of danger. These reservations are hidden from the general public and kept under the control of government agencies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/4eeb15a3323648ad45f08c82102ed7e3.poster.avif?t=1753205187\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/4eeb15a3323648ad45f08c82102ed7e3.webm?t=1753205187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The player takes on the role of a detective from the <strong><i>Paranormal Security Service</i></strong> (PSS), tasked with investigating acts of vandalism in one of these reservations. The investigation is made more difficult by the residents\u2019 hostility and unwillingness to cooperate. Each of them is a unique individual, and it\u2019s your job to find the right approach for each one. You\u2019ll have to complete their requests to earn their trust \u2014 or use your official status to extract the information you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/4f0c0513361dc57007830672f13dfee9.avif?t=1753205187\" /></span>The main character is one of the few agents of the Paranormal Security Service who isn't human. He is just as otherworldly as the residents of the reservation, but unlike most demons, he possesses supernatural abilities that are invaluable in investigations. Beings like him are known as <strong><i>The Faceless</i></strong> \u2014 rare entities with no face who communicate through telepathy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll explore the apartments of a towering panel housing block and converse with various creatures, uncovering new information. This will help you reveal the true situation within the reservation and gain deeper insight into the structure of the paranormal world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/44726be60e3a53f3c99ed683355a16e1.poster.avif?t=1753205187\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/44726be60e3a53f3c99ed683355a16e1.webm?t=1753205187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/44726be60e3a53f3c99ed683355a16e1.mp4?t=1753205187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in for a slow-paced, exploration-driven journey. With a side-view perspective and pixel art visuals, the game lets you move through a multi-story apartment block. Exploration and interaction with characters take place through text-based narration and a dialogue choice system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to solve all assigned tasks while learning about the local otherworldly inhabitants. Helping you along the way is your <strong><i>Personal Pocket Computer</i></strong> (PPC), which can scan paranormal entities and store useful case-related information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/3da7751c57ec989bcc7cff6ac6092760.avif?t=1753205187\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The Devilry Reservation</strong></i> is a place of exile and residence for various members of the paranormal population, most of whom are monsters of varying degrees of danger. These reservations are hidden from the general public and kept under the control of government agencies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/4eeb15a3323648ad45f08c82102ed7e3.poster.avif?t=1753205187\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/4eeb15a3323648ad45f08c82102ed7e3.webm?t=1753205187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>The player takes on the role of a detective from the <strong><i>Paranormal Security Service</i></strong> (PSS), tasked with investigating acts of vandalism in one of these reservations. The investigation is made more difficult by the residents\u2019 hostility and unwillingness to cooperate. Each of them is a unique individual, and it\u2019s your job to find the right approach for each one. You\u2019ll have to complete their requests to earn their trust \u2014 or use your official status to extract the information you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/4f0c0513361dc57007830672f13dfee9.avif?t=1753205187\" /></span>The main character is one of the few agents of the Paranormal Security Service who isn't human. He is just as otherworldly as the residents of the reservation, but unlike most demons, he possesses supernatural abilities that are invaluable in investigations. Beings like him are known as <strong><i>The Faceless</i></strong> \u2014 rare entities with no face who communicate through telepathy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll explore the apartments of a towering panel housing block and converse with various creatures, uncovering new information. This will help you reveal the true situation within the reservation and gain deeper insight into the structure of the paranormal world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/44726be60e3a53f3c99ed683355a16e1.poster.avif?t=1753205187\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/44726be60e3a53f3c99ed683355a16e1.webm?t=1753205187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/44726be60e3a53f3c99ed683355a16e1.mp4?t=1753205187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in for a slow-paced, exploration-driven journey. With a side-view perspective and pixel art visuals, the game lets you move through a multi-story apartment block. Exploration and interaction with characters take place through text-based narration and a dialogue choice system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to solve all assigned tasks while learning about the local otherworldly inhabitants. Helping you along the way is your <strong><i>Personal Pocket Computer</i></strong> (PPC), which can scan paranormal entities and store useful case-related information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2309630/extras/3da7751c57ec989bcc7cff6ac6092760.avif?t=1753205187\" /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Step into the role of a faceless detective investigating creatures from Slavic folklore. Explore dialogue-driven mysteries, solve puzzles, and uncover post-Soviet occult secrets in a pixel art housing block full of bizarre residents and hidden truths",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian, French, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain, German, Japanese, Danish, Norwegian, Finnish, Swedish, Polish",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe Devilry Reservation offers a unique blend of spooky environments and playful characters. It served as a fantastic introduction to this devilishly imaginative episodic adventure.\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 336GameReviews<br><br>\u201cSimple yet engaging 2D exploration game The Devilry Reservation.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 \u0421omuesp<br><br>\u201cThe game is filled with amusing references to everything under the sun. No, scratch that. It's PACKED WITH REFERENCES to memes, movies, and books.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Milla Krabovich<br>",
